        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unionville%2C_Centre_County%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A pink Methodist church built in the 1860s was later transformed into the art exhibit Marry’s Pink Church in 2015.",
